  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-02-04T16:39:34.521Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since you have to have a VRChat account to upload avatars you obviously can only choose them when you log in with your VRChat account. Now here is the problem i and many of my friends share, our VRChat accounts are basically empty while our Steam connected accounts have all the friends, but no avatars. There are also players with more than one VRChat account because they didn't like the first name or are roleplaying on that account an don't want to break character\n\nIdea: create a button, kinda the same with e-mail that says \"partnered account\", you type in your data and have the uploaded avatars on both accounts, so you don't have to play with either no friends or no avatar.",
